  "name": "Cranberry Salad",
  "subtitle": "A chilled cranberry mixture with pineapple, pecans, cream, and marshmallows",
  "description": "Tart cranberries and crushed pineapple are folded with whipped cream, pecans, and marshmallows for a cool, lightly sweet salad.",
